# Keep local-only files out of the Docker / Nixpacks build context:
# repository metadata, IDE files, local secrets, H2 data and build output.
# Everything else (pom.xml, src/, nixpacks.toml, ...) must stay IN the context:
# Nixpacks builds the Maven project from source.
.git
.gitignore
.idea
target
data
*.log
.env
.env.*
/name-suggestion.jar
/extra-names.tsv
